From: Mesh-LLM CI <ci@mesh-llm.local>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] skippy: annotate inkling graph semantics

Generated by tools/skippy-stage-rewriter from compiler-proven builder
shapes. Auxiliary sidecars and whole-model multi-domain graphs are proven
separately and remain outside the primary decoder stage interval.

---
diff --git a/src/models/inkling.cpp b/src/models/inkling.cpp
index 0310612ef9d7fa2d4b2f34651cfa2b78faae6816..ec41cad7c6e7c0934d2f53a6ac6312fe61a32a8f 100644
--- a/src/models/inkling.cpp
+++ b/src/models/inkling.cpp
@@ -645,8 +645,11 @@ llama_model_inkling::graph::graph(const llama_model & model, const llm_graph_par
     ggml_build_forward_expand(gf, cur);
 
     for (int il = 0; il < n_layer; ++il) {
+        begin_block(cur, il);
+
         res->t_layer_inp[il] = cur;
         cur = build_block(cur, il);
+        end_block(cur, il);
     }
 
     ggml_tensor * inp_out_ids = build_inp_out_ids();
